
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.StringToBase64(Text: string): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llStringToBase64(string Text);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use llbase64.encode</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns the string <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Base64" target="_blank">Base64</a> representation of the <b>str</b> interpreted as an UTF-8 byte sequence</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Text / str</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>data_conversion</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">260</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If extra bits are needed to complete the last base64 symbol, those extra bits will be zero.</p>
  <p>To go in the other direction, use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlBase64ToString" target="_blank">llBase64ToString</a>.</p>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function getStringBytes(msg)
    return bit32.arshift(ll.StringLength(tostring(ll.ParseString2List(ll.StringToBase64(msg), {"="}, {}))) * 3, 2)
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer getStringBytes(string msg) {
    return (llStringLength((string)llParseString2List(llStringToBase64(msg), ["="], [])) * 3) >> 2;
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
